---
name: testing-rules
description: PropIQ testing standards.
---

# Authority

TEST_STRATEGY.md

ENGINE_CONTRACTS.md

# Regression Tests

Never change expected values without documented justification.

# Determinism Tests

Repeated executions must return identical outputs.

# Decimal Handling

Use Decimal.

No float comparisons.

Round only at documented boundaries.

# Validation

Test:

- hard failures
- warnings
- risk flags

# Engine Rules

Do not modify formulas to satisfy tests.

Fix tests only if documentation proves the expectation is wrong.

# Forbidden

No hidden fixtures.

No random data.

No time-dependent assertions.